div#imPageRow_5.imPageRow
  div#imPageRowGraphics_5
  div#imPageRowContent_5.imContentDataContainer
    #faq.position-relative
      .text-inner.pt-48px
        .font-28px.text_center.mb-20px
          span.font-.red.mr-4px.ml-4px
            | FREQUENTLY
          span
            | ASKED QUESTIONS
    .accordion
      section.accordion_item
        h3.title_block tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"
          | 1. What is the invitation letter and why do I need it?
        div.info
          p
            | In accordance with Russian Federation law, to get a Russian tourist visa
            b.ml-4px you must have a tourist invitation.
            br
            | A tourist invitation consists of two parts: the tourist confirmation letter (“подтверждение о приеме иностранного туриста” in Russian) and the travel (tourist) voucher.
            |  These documents contain the information you need to fill in your Russian tourist visa application: the name of the travel organization, its address, reference and confirmation numbers.
      section.accordion_item
        h3.title_block tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"
          | 2. What kind of invitation do I need to get a visa to Russia?
        div.info
          p
            | If your trip is planned for up to 30 days, choose a single-entry (or double-entry) tourist invitation. If you would like to visit Russia several times within a 180-day period, choose a tourist invitation for 180 days (multiple-entry). For most Russian consulates, it is enough to have a copy of the invitation (including consulates in India, Europe, the US, Canada, Australia, New Zealand, Japan, China, and others).
      section.accordion_item
        h3.title_block tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"
          | 3. Is your service secure and reliable?
        div.info
          p
            | Our company has been providing reliable visa support services since 1992. We renew our official accreditation with the Ministry of Economic Development of the Russian Federation annually, ensuring strict compliance with all current immigration guidelines. Our reference number is officially registered in the Unified Federal Registry of Tour Operators, guaranteeing the legitimacy of every visa invitation we issue.
          p
            | To ensure the highest level of security, our website utilizes the secure HTTPS protocol. All personal details and payment information are processed using advanced encryption standards, keeping your data safe and strictly confidential.
      section.accordion_item
        h3.title_block tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"
          | 4. Why do invitations from russvisa.com have a great price?
        div.info
          p
            | Thanks to our streamlined and automated process, we provide fast and efficient document processing, helping you save both time and money.
          p
            | We proudly issue visa invitations for citizens of India, the European Union, the United States, Canada, Australia, New Zealand, Japan, and many other countries worldwide.
          p
            | Please note that fees may vary depending on the applicant's nationality and any additional administrative or immigration requirements.
      section.accordion_item
        h3.title_block tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"
          | 5. How do I get a Russian visa with this invitation?
        div.info
          p
            | Print your invitation. Take a color photo (passport size 35x45 mm), a medical insurance policy, and other required documents (a full list can be found on the website of the Russian consulate or visa application center in your country).
          p
            | Fill out the electronic visa application form on the official website of the Consular Department of the Russian Ministry of Foreign Affairs at visa.kdmid.ru. In the form, indicate "Tourism" as the purpose of your trip. Specify the details of the hosting travel organization listed in your invitation: its official name, address, reference number, confirmation number (voucher number), and the hotel(s) where you will be staying.
          p
            | Finally, visit the Russian consulate or visa application center. You will normally receive your Russian visa within 5–7 business days after your appointment.
      section.accordion_item
        h3.title_block tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"
          | 6. Common mistakes in the application form
        div.info
          p
            | The most common mistakes our customers make involve incorrect passport numbers and email addresses.
          p
            | Please carefully double-check all the information in your application before submitting it. An invitation containing incorrect information may be rejected by the Consulate.
      section.accordion_item
        h3.title_block tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false"
          | 7. How else can you help tourists coming to Russia?
        div.info
          p
            | Our company also provides the following additional services:
          ul.faq-services
            li
              b Hotel Booking Assistance
            li
              b Airport Transfers
              p We can arrange transfers from the airport to your accommodation and back. Taxis booked directly at airports or hotels can cost 2–3 times more than transfers booked in advance through us. Please note that airports can be located up to 30 km outside city limits. VIP transfer services are also available upon request.
            li
              b Health Insurance
              p Please note: To obtain a visa at an Embassy or Consulate of the Russian Federation and/or to cross the Russian border at passport control, you must present an international health insurance policy covering the entire period of your stay in the Russian Federation.
              p However, major international insurance systems have stopped operating in Russia due to international sanctions. As a result, international insurance policies are no longer valid in Russia, even if the policy states "Worldwide Coverage".
              p We can help you obtain valid health insurance coverage for the duration of your stay in the Russian Federation.
    p.text_center.mt-16px.pb-48px
      | Need more information or assistance? Please don't hesitate to contact us.
